(: Exploring at the edge of knowledge (

    I explore and create on the edge of knowledge. I think in agential realism, new materialism and panpsychism. I always work closely with Karen Barad, Rupert Sheldrake, Terrence McKenna, Robert Moss and other spiritual beings. I would like open space for new ideas to unfold. I don't want you to deny getting educated on new science, that ruins our ability to genuinely explore what the research says and what that research implies.

) End Exploring at the edge of knowledge :) Thank you so much for reading
